# Client Environment Configuration
# Optional: Set this if your backend API is hosted on a different domain or port (e.g. Render, Railway, VPS, subdomain)
# If left empty, API calls and media requests will automatically use relative paths on the same domain (/api and /uploads)

# Example for Render/Railway/subdomain:
# VITE_API_URL=https://mhada-utsav-api.onrender.com
# VITE_BACKEND_URL=https://mhada-utsav-api.onrender.com
